  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Habitat sustainable resettlement in urban areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Habitat: Sustainable human settlements in urban areas to support reintegration in Afghanistan. The objective of the development cooperation among the parties is to re-integrate returnees through housing and livelihoods support and to demonstrate a fair beneficiary selection approach that could be adopted for other parts of Afghanistan</narrative>
  </description>
