   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.2 Facilitate reintegration through the provision of well-located, serviceable land in proximity to appropriate livelihood opportunities within urban centres, secondary and tertiary cities, and strategic district municipalities in provinces of high return.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275441" vocabulary="99"></reference>
