    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appropriate sites identified, acquired, site planned and provided with basic services as per the PD 305/108</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Appropriate sites identified, acquired, site planned and provided with basic services as per the PD 305/108"></target>
     <actual value="1. Jalalabad: Sites were identified, Master planning and design were completed. However, since site was not selected for development, no basic services were required to be constructed.

2. Herat (Saadat): Sites were identified, Master planning and design were completed. As part of basic services water supply, access roads, and tree planning were completed.

3. Kabul (Eltifat): Sites were identified, Master planning and design were completed. As part of basic services community centre and engineering design for water supply completed including hydro-geological survey."></actual>
    </period>
